structions", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Instructions: Complete the following steps. Fill in the Self Assessment."}]}], "template_override": 1}]}], "_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "Peter's Graduation"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "Finally!"}, {"type": "position", "content": 1}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 13}, {"type": "level", "content": "A2.2"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Accurately use information about people's jobs and places of work in communicative situations."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level"}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level"}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level"}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level"}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level"}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level"}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level"}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Expressions of Time"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You use transition words or connectors to indicate when something happened or was happening. <br><br> These connectors are often followed by the Simple Past tense.They help say when something happened."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":8,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Expression\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Meaning\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"as soon as\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"without delay; quickly\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"yesterday\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"on the day before this one\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"after\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"afterward, later \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"before\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"previous to; earlier or sooner than\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"when\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"at the moment\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"whenever\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"every time;  any time\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"meanwhile\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"at or during the same time\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "She said she would call as soon as she knew."}, {"type": "example", "content": "Whenever I saw a food magazine, I thought of you cooking."}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Simple Past tense  versus  Past Continuous tense"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You use the Simple Past tense to talk about events that are finished. <br> You use the Past Continuous to talk about events or an action that was happening at a time in the past."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Simple Past tense verbs can be regular or irregular. <br> Regular verbs end in <span class=\"italic\">-ed</span> or <span class=\"italic\">-ied</span>. <br> Irregular verbs change in different ways. <br>For questions in the past, you use the auxiliary <span class=\"italic\">did</span> followed by the verb in the base form, like <span class=\"italic\">Did you ask\u2026?.</span>  <br> <span class=\"italic\">Did</span> is the past form of <span class=\"italic\">to do</span>. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "For Past Continuous, we add was/were + verb\u201cing\u201d to verbs. Some verbs need a change to the last letter to add \u201cing\u201d."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":7,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Present\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Past\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Past Continuous\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"talk\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"talked\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" was/were talking\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"get\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"got\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"was/were getting\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"fly\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"flew\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" was/were flying\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"work\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"worked\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"was/were working\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"discuss\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"discussed\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"was/were discussing\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"enjoy\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"enjoyed\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"was/were enjoying\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Did she tell you when she was flying home?"}, {"type": "example", "content": "She said she was getting ready to come back."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "as soon as"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "in the shortest possible time "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(connector)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Call me as soon as you get home! "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le13ob01aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use to talk about school and work life."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "meanwhile "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "while another thing is happening "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adverb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I was working. Meanwhile, he was at the beach having fun. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le13ob01aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to discuss"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to talk about"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: We discussed many different topics. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le13ob01aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "project "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "work completed over a period of time "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I did several projects for my business class. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le13ob01aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "rough"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "hard; difficult; unpleasant"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: It was rough to work and go to school at the same time. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le13ob01aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "whenever"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "every time; any time  "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(connector)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Whenever I call, I have to leave a message."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le13ob01aud06"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to turn in"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to hand; to give to a teacher"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Did you turn in your essay? "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le13ob01aud07"}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn5le13ob01re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Make a list of activities and classes you were involved in last year at this time."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write sentences about them using the Simple Past and the Past Continuous tenses."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Use connectors in your sentences."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Read your sentences aloud to a partner. Listen to your partner's sentences."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I make a list of activities."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I write 50 to 75 words about saying what I was doing and what I did."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I read my sentences aloud."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I listen to a partner speak."}]}], "type": "sena"}